df7f07e6-2e70-4510-87ae-cc2b95ff5540	Percent 5-Man — Official	CSI BCAPL Percentage 5-Man per-game allocation. Winner gets 0.1 per game; loser gets 0. The milestone jumps to 1.5 / 3.0 live in the trigger room, not here.	official	\N	{"base": 0.1, "formula": null}	{"base": 0, "formula": null}	2026-08-26 16:29:22.397349+00	2026-08-26 16:29:22.397349+00
1418ca32-6059-4a22-a8b1-7ea88dc3cb2f	10-Point — Official	CSI 10-Point Scoring System per-game allocation. Winner gets 10; loser gets a scorer-entered value 0-7 (balls pocketed before losing).	official	\N	{"base": 10, "formula": null}	{"base": {"max": 7, "min": 0, "label": "Balls pocketed by loser"}, "formula": null}	2026-08-26 16:29:22.397349+00	2026-08-26 16:29:22.397349+00
e7d0664d-87fa-4553-9fc1-9cf94d6f88c7	17-Point — Official	CSI 17-Point Scoring System (base + formula form). Winner starts with 10 (base), then adds (7 − loser_balls) via the formula. Demonstrates how the base and formula work together. Per-game total always 17.	official	\N	{"base": 10, "formula": {"operationArgs": {"expression": {"op": "+", "kind": "op", "left": {"kind": "var", "name": "this_side_value"}, "right": {"op": "-", "kind": "op", "left": {"kind": "const", "value": 7}, "right": {"kind": "var", "name": "other_side_value"}}}}, "operationKind": "evaluate_expression"}}	{"base": {"max": 7, "min": 0, "label": "Balls pocketed by loser"}, "formula": null}	2026-08-26 16:29:22.397349+00	2026-08-26 16:29:22.397349+00
df95730b-d99e-40b3-b648-3e9c7c4a05c4	17-Point (Single Formula) — Official	Same math as 17-Point, written as a single self-contained formula instead of base + formula. base=0, formula = (17 − loser_balls). Demonstrates that the formula doesn't HAVE to reference the base — you can do it all in one expression.	official	\N	{"base": 0, "formula": {"operationArgs": {"expression": {"op": "-", "kind": "op", "left": {"kind": "const", "value": 17}, "right": {"kind": "var", "name": "other_side_value"}}}, "operationKind": "evaluate_expression"}}	{"base": {"max": 7, "min": 0, "label": "Balls pocketed by loser"}, "formula": null}	2026-08-26 16:29:22.397349+00	2026-08-26 16:29:22.397349+00
92ce1e2f-535d-4d6e-a5d6-ec72c35b4429	Empty Starter	Blank template. Both sides start at 0. Clone this and build a variation from scratch.	official	\N	{"base": 0, "formula": null}	{"base": 0, "formula": null}	2026-08-26 16:29:22.397349+00	2026-08-26 16:29:22.397349+00
